{
  "bodyHash": "73a6a5e460a88115",
  "content": "\n\n<!--suppress HtmlDeprecatedAttribute -->\n\n\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">\n\n<p><img width=\"836\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/banner.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/></p>\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-armors\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=000000&color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=000000&color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveArmors\">\n<img alt=\"GitHub\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://crowdin.com/project/immersive-collection\">\n<img alt=\"通过 Crowdin 翻译\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=crowdin&color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>\n沉浸护甲为游戏添加了大量兼容原版且独特的护甲套装。与千篇一律的护甲不同，沉浸护甲专注于视觉增强的护甲设计，部分护甲还带有披风或自定义模型。其中大多数提供专属效果，如狂暴模式、弹反、尖刺、神圣庇护等。制作配方已正确注册到原版合成表中。附魔、修复和染色功能均按预期工作。\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>40种全新护甲物品，且数量仍在增加中！</p>\n<p>\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=_immersive_armors%3Aarmor&dependencies=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FLuke100000%2FImmersiveArmors%2Ftree%2F1.20.1&resolution=48&background=fancy&row_size=8\" alt=\"生成的图谱图像\"/></p></p>\n\n<h1>木质护甲</h1>\n<p>我不清楚你的想法，但我已经厌倦了被骷髅射杀。这套原始却实用的护甲提供了相当不错的箭矢和爆炸防护。</p>\n<img width=\"450\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=450,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/wood.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>骷髅护甲</h1>\n<p>有没有想过把敌人变成护甲？可能没有，但这里有一套轻便的骷髅护甲。让你移动得更快（甚至能对抗凋灵）。骷髅不再攻击你，反而会对任何试图触碰你的东西造成伤害！</p>\n<img width=\"600\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=600,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/skeleton.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>神圣护甲</h1>\n<p>想脱颖而出吗？来试试这套华丽的金红色护甲吧。你可以随意给布料染色。除了外观精美且拥有极高的防护力外，穿戴完整套神圣护甲每分钟可完全抵挡一次攻击！</p>\n<img width=\"500\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=500,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/divine.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>重型护甲</h1>\n<p>高护甲值、高韧性且几乎不受击退影响，代价是机动性降低。这套护甲专为碾压最强敌人而设计。</p>\n<img width=\"400\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=400,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/heavy.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>史莱姆护甲</h1>\n<p>好吧，我知道这看起来不太像护甲。但相信我，它真的有用。攻击你的敌人会被弹开，爆炸也不会造成太大伤害！不过穿上它之后你可能会有点臭……</p>\n<img width=\"300\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=300,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/slime.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>战士护甲</h1>\n<p>这不仅是维京护甲，穿上它你就是真正的维京人！每损失一点生命值，斧类武器和总伤害都会更高。进入狂暴模式，在残酷的近战搏斗中斩杀你的敌人！</p>\n<img width=\"400\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=400,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/warrior.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>法袍护甲</h1>\n<p>蓬松且可染色的羊毛护甲。内置烈焰棒，会对所有试图攻击你的人造成火焰伤害！另外，它还具有防火特性。毕竟有烈焰棒加持。科学！</p>\n<img width=\"600\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=600,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/robe.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>蒸汽朋克护甲</h1>\n<p>旋转的齿轮、黄铜、指南针、时钟，以及大量的蒸汽。让我为你介绍最复杂的护甲套装——蒸汽朋克护甲。头盔配备敌意雷达系统，潜行时激活。胸甲提供更优化的 GUI，让你再也不怕忘记时间！护腿自带二段跳功能，靴子则因内置蒸汽喷射器而完全免疫摔落伤害。</p>\n<img width=\"500\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=500,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/steampunk.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>海晶护甲</h1>\n<p>利用守卫者的尖刺为自己谋利！这套带刺护甲会对攻击者造成尖刺伤害。虽然坚硬的岩石会降低你的移动速度，但它同时也提供深海探索者效果。</p>\n<img width=\"450\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=450,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/prismarine.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>视频评测！</h1>\n<p style=\"display:block;font-size: 16px; text-align: center;font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif;\">\n<iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kuGRRFDy7vY?wmode=transparent\"\nheight=\"480\" width=\"872\"></iframe>\n</p>\n\n<h1>如何制作？</h1>\n<p>\n所有物品均已整合至原版合成表（及 JEI 等模组）。解锁配方需要收集：骨头、铁块、海晶碎片、羊毛、史莱姆球、活塞、皮革护甲、法袍、凋灵骷髅头颅和原木。\n</p>\n<p>\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=immersive_armors%3A.%2A&dependencies=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FLuke100000%2FImmersiveArmors%2Ftree%2F1.20.1&resolution=16&animated=False&row_width=835\" alt=\"生成的合成表图像\"/></p></p>\n\n<h1>多语言支持</h1>\n<p>\n沉浸护甲已通过机器翻译支持多种语言，但由于质量往往不佳，欢迎加入我们的\n<a href=\"https://crowdin.com/project/immersive-collection\">Crowdin</a> 翻译计划。\n<br/>\n如果你觉得翻译质量不佳请随意投反对票，并贡献你的优质译文。\n</p>\n\n<h1>不兼容项</h1>\n<p>Epic Fight 模组（护甲将使用简陋的替代渲染）</p>\n<p>尝试以低透明度渲染护甲的模组</p>\n\n<h1>集成/联动</h1>\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hostile-humans\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Hostile%20Humans&description=Adds%20Hostile%20Humans%20with%20structures%20into%20your%20world&icon_url=https%3A//media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/798/586/64/64/638160491085728200.jpeg&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"敌对人类\"/>\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h1>沉浸系列模组</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-armors\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Armors&description=A%20lot%20of%20unique%20and%20vanilla-faithful%20armor%20sets.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸护甲\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-aircraft\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Aircraft&description=A%20bunch%20of%20rustic%20aircraft%20to%20travel%2C%20transport%2C%20and%20explore%21&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸飞行器\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-melodies\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Melodies&description=Play%20custom%20melodies%20on%20various%20instruments%20and%20annoy%20your%20friends%21&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸旋律\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-paintings\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Paintings&description=Drag%20and%20drop%2C%20pixelate%20and%20hang%20up%20beautiful%20art.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸画作\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-optimization\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Optimization&description=A%20lightweight%20entity-tick-scheduler%20for%20doubling%20your%20TPS.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸优化\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/selectivebounds\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&description=Hides%20the%20ugly%20block%20selection%20outline%20when%20not%20relevant.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"SelectiveBounds\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/man-of-many-planes\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man%20of%20Many%20Planes&description=A%20set%20of%20additional%20aircraft%20for%20Immersive%20Aircraft%20with%20Create%20support%20in%20mind.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Man of Many Planes\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-machinery\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Machinery&description=A%20bunch%20of%20rustic%20machinery%20to%20transport%2C%20mine%2C%20and%20automate%20things.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸机械\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-furniture\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Furniture&description=Create%20custom%20and%20fancy%20furniture%20in-game%20or%20choose%20from%20a%20vast%20online%20library.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸家具\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-gateways\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Gateways&description=Mysterious%2C%20long-forgotten%20portals%20scattered%20across%20the%20Overworld.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸传送门\"/>\n</a></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>不喜欢这个颜色？部分护甲套装支持染色！</p>\n<img width=\"700\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=700,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/dyeable.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/nostalgia-shader\">\n截图中的光影为 Nostalgia Shader（怀旧光影）\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔线\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n</div>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=1c6d81e57aac0f3dfbd4c31c7e6b7ae7\" alt=\"用于简化页面部署的页面哈希值\"/>",
